Trim the emulated passthrough geometry shader (zortos293/Lichii#1110): only position and the
generics pass through, and only the generics the previous stage writes. Donkey Kong Bananza's
voxel-world pipeline otherwise declared 133 output components (AMD's limit is 128, RADV's too) and
non-generic inputs, and the driver crashed after the golden-banana loading screen.

